        "answer": {
          "short": "$75$",
          "worked": "A row of $n$ shaded tiles has 3 rows of $n+2$ tiles altogether. Thus $T=3n+6$. For $n=23$, $T=3(23)+6=75$ tiles.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 25
      },
